{"sections":[{"slug":"可逆线性范畴层","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"可逆线性范畴层"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">可逆线性范畴层</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"可逆线性范畴层"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">可逆线性范畴层是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">上</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/可逆层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">可逆层</span>"}},{"Plain":" (<span lang=\"zh\">秩为</span> $1$ <span lang=\"zh\">的局部自由</span> $\\mathcal{O}_X$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/范畴化","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴化</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">是特殊的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/高阶拟凝聚层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">高阶拟凝聚层</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">由</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Gestalt","text":"Gestalt"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbf{B}^n\\mathbb G_m$ "},{"Local":{"url":"/分类空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">分类</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">概形</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">可逆线性</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴层</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/高阶拟凝聚层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">高阶拟凝聚层</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的范畴</span> $(n+1)\\mathsf{QCoh}(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的可逆对象</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">也即由</span> $\\mathbb G_m$-<span lang=\"zh\">控制的</span> $n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/束","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">束</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}